  "content": "\n\n<p>本模組由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fowasp.umn.edu%252falexander\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alexander Weimer</a> 製作 - \n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252fa0.ax%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方網站</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/a0ax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.linkedin.com%252fin%252falexander-weimer%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LinkedIn</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=9cVn1s0AAAAJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Google Scholar</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.researchgate.net%252fprofile%252fAlexander-Weimer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ResearchGate</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252forcid.org%252f0009-0009-7313-138X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ORCiD</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjyse.org%252farticles%252ferror-corrected-deep-learning-gregg-shorthand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">學術文章</a></p>\n<h3>Dynamic Village 是 Create 的擴充模組，新增了多種 Create 模組的村莊職業與建築。 <a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/DynamicVillageMod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/x2n2cv6/starongithub.png\" alt=\"star\"></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/sudolev/DynamicVillageMod/assets/61996958/40b915c2-4707-4376-a1c0-5ec6a5a55bcc\" alt=\"banner\"></p>\n<h1>功能列表</h1>\n<p><strong>機械工程師</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>購買與販售 Create 的組件零件</li>\n<li>關鍵方塊：圖表桌</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>液壓工程師</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>購買與販售 Create 的流體管理零件——管線、泵浦、潛水裝備等。</li>\n<li>關鍵方塊：物品排水口</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>列車機械師</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>購買與販售 Create 的列車系統零件</li>\n<li>關鍵方塊：火車站</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>礦工</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>購買與販售 Create 的採礦設備以及礦物／金屬</li>\n<li>關鍵方塊：機械鑽頭</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>總計 20 種平原、熱帶草原、沙漠、針葉林與雪地村莊建築</h3>\n<h1>貢獻</h1>\n<p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ben001109/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Ben001109</a> 將 Dynamic Village 移植至 1.20.1！</strong> 🎉</p>\n<h3>錯誤回報、建議與想法</h3>\n<p>錯誤回報、建議與想法極具價值，我們非常感激。您可以透過 GitHub Issue 聯繫我們。</p>\n<h3>翻譯協助</h3>\n<p>非常感謝您的翻譯協助。最佳方式是建立 GitHub Issue 或提交 Pull Request。</p>\n<p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/EDGW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@EDGW</a> 將 Dynamic Village 翻譯為簡體中文。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/Khaogamermain01\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Khao</a> 將 Dynamic Village 翻譯為泰文。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/RemVan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@RemVan</a> 將 Dynamic Village 翻譯為俄文。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<h3>在 <a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/DynamicVillageMod/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdynamic-village%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 尋找 Dynamic Village</h3>\n<h4>在此 <a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/DynamicVillageMod/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">回報問題</a></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/5srLQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4tvGCgv/dynamicvillage.png\" alt=\"Dynamic Village Banner\"></a></p>",
